According to Gauss's law
Net electric flux passing through closed surface $A$,
$\begin{aligned}
\phi_{A} &=\frac{1}{\varepsilon_{0}}(\text { total charged enclosed by closed surface } A) \\
&=\frac{1}{\varepsilon_{0}} \cdot\left(q_{1}+q_{2}+q_{3}\right)
