&=\frac{-14 \times 10^{-9}+78.85 \times 10^{-9}-56 \times 10^{-9}}{8.85 \times 10^{-12}} \\
&=\frac{8.85}{8.85} \times 10^{-9+12}=10^{3} \mathrm{CN}^{-1} \mathrm{~m}^{-2}
\end{aligned}$

